{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是梵本一字之呪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頌中初句佛說大威德者，三藏云梵本稱說說，\n而筆受者為不順方言故稱佛說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云多根木，三藏云廣州出也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三藏云其木似\n梔子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云橿木"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三藏云其木似榠櫨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云忘憂\n華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云鼢鼠土也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "似梔子花香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出文殊根本儀軌經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頌中初句佛說大威德者，三藏云梵本稱說說，而筆受者為不順方言故稱佛說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《嘉興藏》（日本東京大學綜合圖書館藏正編第73帙第2冊第139圖左欄第5行）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0315042", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0315042", "type": "mod", "text": "經【大】，經出文殊根本儀軌經【元】【明】"}
